  <h1>About Simply Plant Care</h1>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      Simply Plant Care is a small website about one thing: keeping
      houseplants alive. It was started because most plant advice falls into
      two unhelpful camps — vague ("water when needed") or technical enough
      to need a botany degree. We try to sit in the middle: clear, practical
      instructions a beginner can follow, with enough of the "why" to help
      you make your own decisions later.
    </p>
    <h2>Who writes the guides</h2>
    <p>
      Every guide on this site is written and reviewed by
      <a href="/author/zeeshan-farooq/">Zeeshan Farooq</a>, a plants
      researcher. He researches indoor plant care — watering, light, soil,
      and the common problems that kill houseplants — and checks each guide
      against public references from university extension services and
      botanical gardens. Read more on his
      <a href="/author/zeeshan-farooq/">author page</a>.
    </p>
    <p>
      Follow Simply Plant Care on
